steps.text:
分析 利用分子是分母的高阶无穷小，可得到几个不同的极限式，从而解出所求的常数. 解 因为

\lim _ {x \rightarrow 1} \frac {a (x - 1) ^ {2} + b (x - 1) + c - \sqrt {x ^ {2} + 3}}{(x - 1) ^ {2}} = 0,\tag{①}

所以

a (x - 1) ^ {2} + b (x - 1) + c - \sqrt {x ^ {2} + 3} = o ((x - 1) ^ {2}).\tag{②}

则有

\left\{\begin{array}{l}\lim _ {x \rightarrow 1} \left(a (x - 1) ^ {2} + b (x - 1) + c - \sqrt {x ^ {2} + 3}\right) = 0,\\\lim _ {x \rightarrow 1} \frac {a (x - 1) ^ {2} + b (x - 1) + c - \sqrt {x ^ {2} + 3}}{x - 1} = 0.\end{array}\right.\tag{③}

④

由③式得 $c = 2$ ，代入④式得

b = \lim _ {x \rightarrow 1} \frac {\sqrt {x ^ {2} + 3} - 2}{x - 1} = \lim _ {x \rightarrow 1} \frac {x ^ {2} - 1}{(x - 1) (\sqrt {x ^ {2} + 3} + 2)} = \frac {1}{2}.

将 $c = 2, b = \frac{1}{2}$ 代入①式得

\begin{array}{r l}a&= - \lim _ {x \rightarrow 1} \frac {\frac {1}{2} (x - 1) + 2 - \sqrt {x ^ {2} + 3}}{(x - 1) ^ {2}} = - \frac {1}{2} \lim _ {x \rightarrow 1} \frac {x + 3 - 2 \sqrt {x ^ {2} + 3}}{(x - 1) ^ {2}}\\&= \frac {3}{2} \lim _ {x \rightarrow 1} \frac {(x - 1) ^ {2}}{(x - 1) ^ {2} (x + 3 + 2 \sqrt {x ^ {2} + 3})} = \frac {3}{1 6}.\end{array}
